Project Demonstration
Project Title
Auto Ticket Classification System
Project Purpose
The purpose of this project is to automatically classify support tickets into appropriate categories based on the ticket description.
Project Benefits
Reduces manual ticket classification.
Saves time.
Improves ticket organization.
Provides quick classification results.
Helps support teams manage tickets efficiently.
Project Execution
First, the user enters the support ticket description into the system. The submitted ticket is then processed by the system. The classification model analyzes the ticket description and identifies the appropriate category. Finally, the predicted category is displayed to the user.
Final Output
The system successfully analyzes the submitted support ticket and automatically displays the appropriate ticket category.
